---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// GitHub, October 2018: where the primary sits relative to the apps. Facts from the post text.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="Before the failover, applications in the East Coast data center talk to a primary in the same data center, with replicas on the West Coast. After Orchestrator promotes a West Coast replica, the East Coast applications must reach the new primary across the country on most database calls.">
    <text x="225" y="26" text-anchor="middle" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Before: the primary is next to the apps</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trước: primary nằm cạnh ứng dụng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="10" y="44" width="170" height="170" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="95" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>East Coast</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bờ Đông</tspan></text>
    <rect x="270" y="44" width="170" height="170" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="355" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>West Coast</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bờ Tây</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={52} y={126} size={34} />
    <text x="52" y="164" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>apps</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ứng dụng</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={138} y={126} size={34} />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={355} y={126} size={34} />
    <text x="138" y="164" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>primary</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>primary</tspan></text>
    <text x="355" y="164" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>replica</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>replica</tspan></text>
    <line x1="66.0" y1="126.0" x2="93.0" y2="126.0" class="edge ok" /><polygon points="102.0,126.0 93.0,121.5 93.0,130.5" class="head ok" />
    <line x1="150.0" y1="126.0" x2="311.0" y2="126.0" class="edge dash" /><polygon points="320.0,126.0 311.0,121.5 311.0,130.5" class="head dash" />
    <text x="235" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>replication</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sao chép</tspan></text>
    <text x="225" y="266" text-anchor="middle" class="t-ok"><tspan data-lang-en>Most database calls stay in the East.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phần lớn lệnh gọi database ở lại bờ Đông.</tspan></text>
    <text x="675" y="26" text-anchor="middle" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>After: a West Coast replica is promoted</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sau: một replica bờ Tây được đẩy lên</tspan></text>
    <rect x="460" y="44" width="170" height="170" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="545" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>East Coast</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bờ Đông</tspan></text>
    <rect x="720" y="44" width="170" height="170" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="805" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>West Coast</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bờ Tây</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={502} y={126} size={34} />
    <text x="502" y="164" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>apps</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ứng dụng</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={588} y={126} size={34} />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={805} y={126} size={34} />
    <text x="588" y="164" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>old primary</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>primary cũ</tspan></text>
    <text x="805" y="164" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>new primary</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>primary mới</tspan></text>
    <path d="M502,184 Q646,300 797.7,189.3" class="edge bad" /><polygon points="805.0,184.0 795.1,185.7 800.4,192.9" class="head bad" />
    <text x="646" y="266" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>cross-country round trip</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một vòng đi về xuyên lục địa</tspan></text>
    <text x="646" y="284" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>on most database calls</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trên phần lớn lệnh gọi database</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Same database, same apps, but the primary moved. For the database it was a valid move; for applications in the East, most calls now cross the country.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng database, cùng ứng dụng, nhưng primary đã dời chỗ. Với database đó là nước đi hợp lệ; với ứng dụng ở bờ Đông, phần lớn lệnh gọi giờ phải băng qua cả nước.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
